1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
These dates look perfect for Ummi's basket.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Amira, look—

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
It's... someone's wallet. It has money in it.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,000
No one's even looking...

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Zayd? What's wrong?

6
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,000
I don't know what to do. Part of me wants to just... keep it.

7
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,500
It's not ours though.

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Sidq means telling the truth about it. And amanah means taking care
of it properly, since it isn't mine.

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,500
I've decided what's right. Now I'll trust Allah with the rest.

10
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Excuse me — I found this wallet near your stall.

11
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:25,000
This is mine! Thank you, truly — that was very honest of you.

12
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Hasbunallahu wa ni'mal wakeel.

13
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:21,000
That felt like the right thing, didn't it?

14
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:22,500
It did.
